+| S17 | `semantic.k:100` true branch | Selects `THEN`; discards `ELSE`. | Faithful conditional behavior. |
+| S18 | `semantic.k:101` false branch | Selects `ELSE`; discards `THEN`. | Faithful conditional behavior, including `.Stmts`. |
